I agree that NHSOUND should have an unload from memory option
rather than making you reboot.  However, there are generic 
utilities out there that let you do this with any TSR.  
The one I've seen is called mark-and-release and has two little 
programs to mark memory before you load a TSR and to release 
that memory later, unloading the TSR.  I forget the exact archive
filename and which ftp site has it, but dig around Simtel or other
DOS utility sites and you'll find it.  

